        "reply": "# Gift cards and gift returns\n\nNorthwind digital gift cards are emailed to the recipient after payment is confirmed.\nThey do not expire and are redeemable only at Northwind checkout. A remaining\nbalance stays on the card for a future purchase. Gift cards cannot be exchanged\nfor cash and cannot be used to buy another gift card.\n\n## Returning a gift\n\nAn eligible gift return needs a gift receipt or the original order number and must\nmeet the normal unused-with-tags 30-day return requirement. The recipient receives\nstore credit; Northwind does not send the recipient a refund to somebody else's\ncard. The purchaser may request an original-payment refund through support instead.\n\n## Lost gift emails\n\nAsk support to resend the gift email after ownership is verified. Do not post a full\ngift-card co",
